# bff/publish.config
# Explicit list of paths to publish to DuendeSoftware/products for the legacy
# releases/bff/2.2.x branch. This branch keeps the pre-monorepo root layout
# (src/, test/, samples/, Duende.Bff.sln at the repository root), so there is
# no remap: paths are published as-is.
#
# This file lives in bff/ (not the root) so RepoTool's product directory
# resolution ("libs/bff" -> "bff") finds it, and so release.yml's libs/bff
# settings (working directory "bff", pack target "bff.slnx") work unchanged.
#
# Root-level files (global.json, nuget.config, Duende.Bff.sln, LICENSE, icon.png,
# README.md, .config/) are handled by RepoTool's FileFilter. Root *.props/*.targets
# are not, so they are listed explicitly below.
#
# Pattern types:
#   directory/  - trailing slash matches everything under that directory
#   exact/path  - matches that specific file

# Product source
src/
test/
samples/
migrations/
build/

# Release shim (pack target used by release.yml)
bff/

# Root build configuration
Directory.Build.props
Directory.Build.targets
NuGetAudit.NonShipping.props